<title>HONG KONG: India's Birla AT&amp;T mandates loan facility.</title>
<headline>India's Birla AT&amp;T mandates loan facility.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Birla AT &amp; T Communications has mandated Bank of America and Toronto Dominion Bank to arrange a loan facility, Bank of America said in a statement.</p>
<p>The borrower is a special purpose company, owned 51 percent by Aditya V Birla Group and 49 percent by AT&amp;T.</p>
<p>Proceeds are partly to finance the construction and operation of cellular telephone networks in the Indian telecom circles of Maharashtra and Gujarat.</p>
<p>The loan facility will be non-recourse to the shareholders.</p>
<p>No further details are available.</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
